%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% Scenario: an axial shading with an array of functions. Three
% one-output functions, one per RGB component, replace a single
% three-output function: red falls, green rises and falls through an
% exponent of 2, blue rises; the shading names them as an array.
gsave
100 600 300 80 rectclip
<< /ShadingType 2 /ColorSpace /DeviceRGB /Coords [100 0 400 0]
   /Function [
     << /FunctionType 2 /Domain [0 1] /C0 [1] /C1 [0] /N 1 >>
     << /FunctionType 2 /Domain [0 1] /C0 [0.2] /C1 [0.8] /N 2 >>
     << /FunctionType 2 /Domain [0 1] /C0 [0] /C1 [1] /N 1 >> ] >> shfill
grestore
showpage
